  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.45 - AM031 SequenceEqual and static LINQ enumeration tracking\n\n            Changed:\n            - AM031 multiple-enumeration tracking now covers SequenceEqual as a terminal LINQ operation\n            - SequenceEqual tracks both sequence inputs, including captured/local second-sequence arguments\n            - Static Enumerable/Queryable terminal calls are keyed to source sequence arguments\n\n            Validation:\n            - Full solution test suite passing on net10.0 (851 tests)\n            - Rule catalog and sample diagnostics snapshot checks passing\n            - PR #120 CI/package smoke checks passing\n            - git diff --check clean\n\n            Previous Release: v2.30.44 - AM031 LINQ terminal enumeration coverage",
